<title>NETHERLANDS: Waigel says EU jobs resolution means no more spend.</title>
<headline>Waigel says EU jobs resolution means no more spend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said on Monday that the employment resolution agreed earlier by EU finance ministers involved no additional spending.</p>
<p>Reporting to journalists after the ministers' meeting, he said: &quot;The employment resolution is so arranged that no additional financial resources are involved.&quot;</p>
</text>
